{"id":"n41588-1-7","stage":2,"title":"눈사람 · 雪人","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41588-1-7-1","ko":"와, 밤새 눈이 많이 내렸네.","zh":"哇，一整晚都下了好多雪啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦。","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"밤새","meaning":"整晚，整夜","explanation":"밤새：整晚，整夜。","readings":[{"term":"밤새","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15467","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤새","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3"}},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"내렸네.","meaning":"下，落","explanation":"내리다：下，落；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"1","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내렸네","audio":"/audio/05bbeceb1eefb1f9ce5c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"5cc956034440dea8","term":"밤새","zh":"整晚，整夜","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3",